            "type": "note",
            "text": "Boids Flocking Simulation\n\nSourcePOP emits particles \u2192 BoidsPOP applies Reynolds flocking rules:\n\u2022 Separation: steer away from close neighbors\n\u2022 Alignment: match average velocity of nearby flock\n\u2022 Cohesion: steer toward flock center\n\nSpherical boundary keeps the flock contained.\nAll three weights are adjustable. Try:\n\u2022 High separation + low cohesion = scattered\n\u2022 High cohesion + low separation = tight swarm\n\u2022 High alignment = schooling fish behavior",
